{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54630","headline":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雷第九（京本列第二十五○三十一首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵发日，风送逆雷声。\n天意欲将（京本作「显然」）兵仔细，不宜先举恐伤危，遇敌恐（京本作「必」）遭摧。\n（京本注：夫雷霆者，天地之成，震则以惊万物，兵者尤宜祭之。\n凡雷霆於将军士卒，宜擐甲张弦，其兵得天助也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}